# Sneak through the turn driver (ADR-0026): ai has no creature, so the
# driven declare blockers step declares no block, and every attacker's
# blocked status is decided (Combat.isUnblocked). In that step's priority
# round human taps a Plains and casts Leonardo, Big Brother for its Sneak
# cost {W}, returning the unblocked Silvercoat Lion. Leonardo resolves when
# both pass, enters tapped and attacking ai, and deals 1 in the combat damage
# step. Four steps from Untap reach Declare Attackers (turn 1 skips the draw
# step); three more run Declare Blockers, First Strike Damage, Combat Damage.
startturn human
queue attackers 1
queue attacktarget ai
step 4
queue action human tapformana 5 W
queue action human cast 3
queue returnchoice 1
step 3
